.chr/user/plans/cli-gameplay-plan.md:17:Workspace decision discovery found no ADR, RFC, decision-log, engineering-principles, or similarly named architecture decision documents. The binding constraints are `AGENTS.md`, `.agents/CONVENTIONS.md`, the curated project and CLI gameplay docs, the quiz answers, and the existing spec and plan context: use only Go's standard library, keep rules in `internal/game`, keep process I/O in `cmd/tictactoe`, reject invalid moves without advancing the turn, and exclude replay, AI, persistence, networking, colors, profiles, and terminal UI packages.
